  StyleBox["network", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "bd32f863-8ce6-4444-9abe-91c21cb2f3a6"],
 "."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->868496656,ExpressionUUID->"8dffd07f-e003-476a-8a2c-8906883ca08d"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The tape is the oblivious ring machine tape given by ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["AutomataNetworkToObliviousRingMachineInit"]], 
    "paclet:EricJamesParfitt/CyclicTagCompiler/ref/\
AutomataNetworkToObliviousRingMachineInit", "EricJamesParfitt Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "4d05ebe0-486c-4f72-acbf-1e8ef62f80b8"],
 ", with each cell encoded as a block of cyclic tag cells."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->554886555,ExpressionUUID->"cfd93da4-2dbd-48ea-9eb1-0e938ad4f7ba"],

Cell["The following options can be given:", "Notes",
 CellID->224146467,ExpressionUUID->"b9662918-40bb-47e3-81be-4711ca5a3415"],

Cell[BoxData[GridBox[{
   {Cell["      ", "TableRowIcon",ExpressionUUID->
     "6cc3a071-0b68-4e9a-908a-83bedf7f0afa"], "\"\<TargetSystem\>\"", 
    TemplateBox[{
      Cell[
       TextData["Automatic"]], "paclet:ref/Automatic"},
     "RefLink",
     BaseStyle->{"3ColumnTableMod"}], Cell[
    "the kind of cyclic tag system to compile to", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "d5a5da29-03a1-4221-8423-4b4cb7dd4774"]},
   {Cell["      ", "TableRowIcon",ExpressionUUID->
     "789e9b17-cebd-49c6-bb8d-1f9b4113ddfd"], "\"\<Optimization\>\"", \
"\"\<DeletedSymbolsHighest\>\"", Cell[
    "which optimization of the encoding to use", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "4052fe9f-156a-43ad-b4bd-e563b375b7e9"]}
  }]], "3ColumnTableMod",
 GridBoxOptions->{
 GridBoxBackground->{"Columns" -> {{None}}, "Rows" -> {None, {None}}},
 GridBoxDividers->{"Rows" -> {{True, True, True}}}},
 CellID->127789472,ExpressionUUID->"4606d9b2-5cbc-4eb1-9634-c8ef36e872f2"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Use the same ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["states", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "7cea4f64-a472-4e14-b635-9ee1bc5237dd"],
 " and option settings as for the rule, step count and decoding."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->50335016,ExpressionUUID->"301a2aba-29ec-4051-b9f3-afc5cf360083"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "With ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"\"\<Optimization\>\"", " ", "->", 
   " ", "\"\<DeletedSymbolsHighest\>\""}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "2f046af4-c573-4146-b3e9-691b0c13e3bb"],
 ", the default, the symbol columns that every ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["n", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "8fb044e0-4917-4266-88cf-dda2560bcff1"],
 "-ary rule part leaves empty are left out of the encoding. Nothing in the \
compiled cyclic tag system ever appends for those symbols, so leaving them \
out makes every block narrower and every step cheaper."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->707100217,ExpressionUUID->"95734bbc-4917-4cba-9132-9ce763ecc0ee"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The compilation is then faithful up to a relabeling of the symbols: each \
symbol that survives is renamed to its position among the survivors, and \
every symbol that is left out decodes to one label that no surviving symbol \
uses. The decoded evolution therefore behaves like the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["n", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "4111db47-e801-43a8-a9dd-682126c1b98c"],
 "-ary one with its symbols renumbered, and is identical to it when there is \
nothing to leave out."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->707100224,ExpressionUUID->"ed957ee8-9291-433a-a409-d20a9ddcf88e"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "No other setting is implemented yet. ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["AutomataNetworkToCyclicTagInit"]], 
    "paclet:EricJamesParfitt/CyclicTagCompiler/ref/\
AutomataNetworkToCyclicTagInit", "EricJamesParfitt Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "a2c68abf-c5c0-4a4d-a460-2c2881e31db7"],
 " stays unevaluated when it is given any other value, rather than quietly \
compiling something else."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->707100231,ExpressionUUID->"a29110e8-324c-4cad-a64d-8add5968ac79"]
}, Closed]],

